      "sourceText": "- C++17 之前需要通过 `.first/.second`、`std::get<N>()`、成员名或数组下标分别取值。\n- C++17 结构化绑定可以把 pair / tuple / 结构体 / 数组分解成独立变量。\n- C++17 基本语法是 `auto [var1, var2, ...] = expression`。\n- 遍历 map 时 `[key, value]` 是最佳实践（C++17）。\n- insert 返回值用 `[iterator, bool]` 解包非常清晰。",
      "translatedText": "- C++17 Before, it was necessary to access values separately via `.first/.second`、`std::get<N>()`、member names, or array subscripts\\.\n- C++17 Structured bindings can decompose a pair / tuple / struct / array into independent variables\\.\n- C++17 The basic syntax is `auto [var1, var2, ...] = expression`\\.\n- When iterating over a map, `[key, value]` is the best practice (C++17)\\.\n- Unpacking the insert return value with `[iterator, bool]` is very clear\\.",
